--- !u!1001 &284469210
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 415652084}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 518007960451841433, guid: 2d7b93edaa776914794682e1b44a0cde, type: 3}
      propertyPath: linhasDialogo.Array.size
      value: 6
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 518007960451841433, guid: 2d7b93edaa776914794682e1b44a0cde, type: 3}
      propertyPath: linhasDialogo.Array.data[0]
      value: "Jogador: Sabe o que causou o apag\xE3o?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 518007960451841433, guid: 2d7b93edaa776914794682e1b44a0cde, type: 3}
      propertyPath: linhasDialogo.Array.data[1]
      value: "Rafael: Sobrecarregou dos dois lados da cidade. O sistema \xE9 interligado:
        se um cai, o outro precisa compensar."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 518007960451841433, guid: 2d7b93edaa776914794682e1b44a0cde, type: 3}
      propertyPath: linhasDialogo.Array.data[2]
      value: "Jogador: Ent\xE3o se consertarem s\xF3 um lado\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 518007960451841433, guid: 2d7b93edaa776914794682e1b44a0cde, type: 3}
      propertyPath: linhasDialogo.Array.data[3]
      value: "Rafael: A energia n\xE3o volta. Tem que religar os dois ao mesmo tempo,
        como equilibrar dois pratos."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 518007960451841433, guid: 2d7b93edaa776914794682e1b44a0cde, type: 3}
      propertyPath: linhasDialogo.Array.data[4]
      value: 'Jogador: Vou avisar o pessoal do outro lado.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 518007960451841433, guid: 2d7b93edaa776914794682e1b44a0cde, type: 3}
      propertyPath: linhasDialogo.Array.data[5]
      value: "Rafael: \xC9 o certo. Sem sincronizar, n\xE3o funciona."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 518007960451841433, guid: 2d7b93edaa776914794682e1b44a0cde, type: 3}
      propertyPath: linhasDialogo.Array.data[6]
      value: "Dona Vera: Trabalhador de verdade n\xE3o vive de favor. Aqui a luz
        nem pisca."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 518007960451841433, guid: 2d7b93edaa776914794682e1b44a0cde, type: 3}
      propertyPath: linhasDialogo.Array.data[7]
      value: "Dona Vera: Ah, meu querido, trabalhador de verdade n\xE3o vive de favor.
        Enfim, a culpa \xE9 deles. Aqui, gra\xE7as a Deus, a luz n\xE3o pisca nem
        por um segundo."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 767309303545422533, guid: 2d7b93edaa776914794682e1b44a0cde, type: 3}
      propertyPath: sceneViewId
      value: 38
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221028148638086121, guid: 2d7b93edaa776914794682e1b44a0cde, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: NPC 1 (8)
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2807461431448035721, guid: 2d7b93edaa776914794682e1b44a0cde, type: 3}
